1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,714
What do you do on your turn?

2
00:00:02,034 --> 00:00:03,634
Just three simple steps.

3
00:00:04,666 --> 00:00:05,605
Step one.

4
00:00:05,925 --> 00:00:07,759
Pick one of your face-up cards.

5
00:00:08,866 --> 00:00:09,869
Step two.

6
00:00:10,189 --> 00:00:11,576
Do what the card says.

7
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:13,681
Step three.

8
00:00:14,001 --> 00:00:15,622
Turn that card face-down.

9
00:00:15,942 --> 00:00:17,734
Then the other player has a turn.

10
00:00:18,866 --> 00:00:20,167
Let's watch Ana.

11
00:00:20,487 --> 00:00:22,130
She picks Take One Stone.

12
00:00:23,983 --> 00:00:26,671
She takes one stone from the bowl, the red one.

13
00:00:26,991 --> 00:00:28,506
She puts it on her Rabbit.

14
00:00:29,633 --> 00:00:31,532
Then she turns the card face-down.

15
00:00:31,852 --> 00:00:33,153
Her turn is over.

16
00:00:33,473 --> 00:00:35,564
The picture on the back is for later.

17
00:00:36,666 --> 00:00:38,096
Now it's Ben's turn.

18
00:00:38,416 --> 00:00:40,101
He picks Take Two Stones.

19
00:00:42,183 --> 00:00:44,871
He takes two stones from the bowl, both white.

20
00:00:45,191 --> 00:00:46,769
He gives them to his Turtle.

21
00:00:47,089 --> 00:00:49,031
Then he turns the card face-down.

22
00:00:50,133 --> 00:00:52,821
You can only pick a card that you can really do.

23
00:00:53,141 --> 00:00:55,957
Take Two Stones needs two stones in the bowl.

24
00:00:57,066 --> 00:00:58,303
Ana's turn again.

25
00:00:58,623 --> 00:01:01,397
This time she picks Add Two Stones and Take One.

26
00:01:03,449 --> 00:01:06,841
First, she draws two stones from the bag, without looking.

27
00:01:07,161 --> 00:01:08,548
They go into the bowl.

28
00:01:10,416 --> 00:01:12,976
Then she takes one, the yellow, for her Rabbit.

29
00:01:13,296 --> 00:01:15,024
And the card goes face-down.

30
00:01:16,133 --> 00:01:17,733
Look at Ana's cards now.

31
00:01:18,053 --> 00:01:19,397
Three are face-down.

32
00:01:19,717 --> 00:01:21,466
She can't use them for a while.

33
00:01:21,786 --> 00:01:24,368
Episode seven shows how to get them back.

34
00:01:26,250 --> 00:01:27,807
One more time, with Ben.

35
00:01:28,127 --> 00:01:30,986
He picks a card, does it, and turns it face-down.

36
00:01:32,100 --> 00:01:32,996
Remember.

37
00:01:33,316 --> 00:01:35,684
On your turn, pick one face-up card.

38
00:01:36,004 --> 00:01:37,070
Do what it says.

39
00:01:37,390 --> 00:01:38,905
Then turn it face-down.

40
00:01:39,225 --> 00:01:41,166
Next: where your stones can go.
